		(descr "Murata LFB18 series integrated balun-filter, 1.6x0.8mm body, 6 terminals. Part: LFB182G45BG5D920. Dual-row 1608 land: 3 pads per long side at 0.5mm pitch, row separation 0.7mm centre-to-centre. Pad numbering: row A (negative-y / top in schematic view) left-to-right = pads 1,2,3; row B (positive-y / bottom) left-to-right = pads 4,5,6. Schematic mapping: pad1=UNBAL, pad2=GND, pad3=RF_N(BAL), pad4=RF_P(BAL), pad5=GND, pad6=GND. [VERIFY pad numbering and row assignment against Murata land pattern QNET2207 / LFB182G45BG5D920 datasheet before layout]")
